<note place="foot" n="**)" xml:id="fn1.2" prev="#fn1.1"><p>Mein verehrungswerther Freund, <choice><abbr>Hr.</abbr><expan>Herr</expan></choice> Professor <hi rendition="#g"><persName>Erman</persName></hi>, hat<lb/>
